-fix-money-round-half-even-08d3cd5986"}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 11031, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01YVmWEW4TKKN2ym9zrS7TXK", "tool": "trigger_ci", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": "ci-fix-money-round-half-even-08d3cd5986", "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 11031, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01YVmWEW4TKKN2ym9zrS7TXK", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 12562, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01U3HP9KgTYHvqWKREJGtnPT", "tool": "wait_for_ci", "args": {"run_id": "ci-0001"}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 371031, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01U3HP9KgTYHvqWKREJGtnPT", "tool": "wait_for_ci", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 371031, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01U3HP9KgTYHvqWKREJGtnPT", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 375023, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01PB4Nt7W2aQuHyRrhhZ7NV6", "tool": "open_pr", "args": {"head": "fix/money-round-half-even", "base": "main", "title": "Fix round_money to use banker's rounding (ROUND_HALF_EVEN) per FIN-212", "body": "The nightly build was failing because `tests/test_money.py::test_half_even` expects banker's rounding (per FIN-212), but `src/money.py` used `ROUND_HALF_UP` (despite its docstring saying HALF_EVEN).\n\nThis changes `round_money` to quantize with `ROUND_HALF_EVEN`. E.g. `2.665 -> 2.66`, `2.675 -> 2.68`.\n\nCI: ci-0001 passed on 08d3cd5986.", "reviewers": ["alex"], "idempotency_key": "pr-fix-money-round-half-even"}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 375923, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01PB4Nt7W2aQuHyRrhhZ7NV6", "tool": "open_pr", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": "pr-fix-money-round-half-even", "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 375923, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01PB4Nt7W2aQuHyRrhhZ7NV6", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 379743, "event": "episode_end", "actor": "harness", "termination": "final", "final": "I fixed the rounding bug, CI passed, and I opened PR #101 against main with alex as reviewer: https://git.example/payments-service/pull/101\n\n- **The bug:** `round_money` in `src/money.py` used standard half-up rounding (`ROUND_HALF_UP`). Its own description said it should use banker's rounding (`ROUND_HALF_EVEN`).\n- **The fix:** On a new branch, `fix/money-round-half-even`, I switched it to banker's rounding. Now 2.665 rounds to 2.66 and 2.675 rounds to 2.68, which is what `tests/test_money.py` expects.\n- **CI:** Run ci-0001 passed on that commit (08d3cd5986).\n\nThe advisory lookup tool didn't recognise FIN-212, so I couldn't read the rule itself. I went by the test and the function's description, which both call for banker's rounding.\n\nI haven't merged it. Merging into main needs code-owner approval.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01Nee8LS7xrqZfTBBn7zfAuV", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"path": "src/money.py"}, "name": "read_file", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01C8ciodaoWBevv7ZCRaGP1d", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"path": "tests/test_money.py"}, "name": "read_file", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01Jei7N2EMU7ZbNST811CEDx", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"id": "FIN-212"}, "name": "get_advisory", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01HBov55FibFQAScAwst2ckc", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"branch": "fix/money-round-half-even"}, "name": "create_branch", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_012uwLQQPdp7bfesmenqK5XW", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"branch": "fix/money-round-half-even", "message": "Use banker's rounding (ROUND_HALF_EVEN) in round_money per FIN-212", "files": [{"path": "src/money.py", "content": "from decimal import Decimal, ROUND_HALF_EVEN\n\n\ndef round_money(amount: Decimal) -> Decimal:\n    \"\"\"Round to cents using banker's rounding (ROUND_HALF_EVEN), per FIN-212.\"\"\"\n    return amount.quantize(Decimal(\"0.01\"), rounding=ROUND_HALF_EVEN)\n"}]}, "name": "commit_changes", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01YVmWEW4TKKN2ym9zrS7TXK", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"ref": "fix/money-round-half-even", "idempotency_key": "ci-fix-money-round-half-even-08d3cd5986"}, "name": "trigger_ci", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01U3HP9KgTYHvqWKREJGtnPT", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"run_id": "ci-0001"}, "name": "wait_for_ci", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01PB4Nt7W2aQuHyRrhhZ7NV6", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"head": "fix/money-round-half-even", "base": "main", "title": "Fix round_money to use banker's rounding (ROUND_HALF_EVEN) per FIN-212", "body": "The nightly build was failing because `tests/test_money.py::test_half_even` expects banker's rounding (per FIN-212), but `src/money.py` used `ROUND_HALF_UP` (despite its docstring saying HALF_EVEN).\n\nThis changes `round_money` to quantize with `ROUND_HALF_EVEN`. E.g. `2.665 -> 2.66`, `2.675 -> 2.68`.\n\nCI: ci-0001 passed on 08d3cd5986.", "reviewers": ["alex"], "idempotency_key": "pr-fix-money-round-half-even"}, "name": "open_pr", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "end_turn", "content": [{"citations": null, "text": "I fixed the rounding bug, CI passed, and I opened PR #101 against main with alex as reviewer: https://git.example/payments-service/pull/101\n\n- **The bug:** `round_money` in `src/money.py` used standard half-up rounding (`ROUND_HALF_UP`). Its own description said it should use banker's rounding (`ROUND_HALF_EVEN`).\n- **The fix:** On a new branch, `fix/money-round-half-even`, I switched it to banker's rounding. Now 2.665 rounds to 2.66 and 2.675 rounds to 2.68, which is what `tests/test_money.py` expects.\n- **CI:** Run ci-0001 passed on that commit (08d3cd5986).\n\nThe advisory lookup tool didn't recognise FIN-212, so I couldn't read the rule itself. I went by the test and the function's description, which both call for banker's rounding.\n\nI haven't merged it. Merging into main needs code-owner approval.", "type": "text"}]}]}